  "description": "<div>\r\n<p style=\"white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-end=\"269\" data-start=\"193\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">&bull;<span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"> Brand introduction: &nbsp;</span></span>Welcome to <strong data-end=\"225\" data-start=\"204\">Vanity Collective</strong> &mdash; where simplicity meets skin confidence.</p>\r\n<p style=\"white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-end=\"621\" data-start=\"271\">We believe skincare should be effective, effortless, and empowering. That&rsquo;s why we created the <strong data-end=\"390\" data-start=\"366\">Clear Collection Box</strong> &mdash; a curated 3-step system designed to cleanse, treat, and moisturize your skin in under 5 minutes a day. No complicated routines, no overwhelming product shelves &mdash; just clean, results-driven formulas that work with your lifestyle.</p>\r\n<p style=\"white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-end=\"913\" data-start=\"623\">At Vanity Collective, we&rsquo;re more than a skincare brand &mdash; we&rsquo;re your daily dose of self-care. Our mission is to help you feel confident in your skin, every day. Whether you&rsquo;re dealing with breakouts, dullness, or just want a routine that <em data-end=\"870\" data-start=\"860\">actually</em> fits into your day, we&rsquo;ve got you covered.</p>\r\n<p style=\"white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-end=\"967\" data-start=\"915\">Glowing skin starts here &mdash; and it starts with you.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&bull; USP (Unique Selling Point):&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<ol style=\"white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-end=\"1051\" data-start=\"311\">\r\n<li data-end=\"498\" data-start=\"311\" style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">\r\n<p data-end=\"498\" data-start=\"314\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong data-end=\"340\" data-start=\"314\">Time-Saving Simplicity</strong></span><br data-end=\"343\" data-start=\"340\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><em data-end=\"498\" data-start=\"346\">&ldquo;Skincare shouldn&rsquo;t be complicated. Our 3-step Clear Collection Box gives you maximum results with minimal effort &mdash; because your glow shouldn&rsquo;t wait.&rdquo;</em></span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"691\" data-start=\"500\" style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">\r\n<p data-end=\"691\" data-start=\"503\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong data-end=\"541\" data-start=\"503\">Targeted for Clear, Confident Skin</strong></span><br data-end=\"544\" data-start=\"541\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><em data-end=\"691\" data-start=\"547\">&ldquo;Formulated to fight breakouts, boost hydration, and reveal your natural glow &mdash; the Clear Collection Box is your shortcut to skin confidence.&rdquo;</em></span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"893\" data-start=\"693\" style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">\r\n<p data-end=\"893\" data-start=\"696\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong data-end=\"729\" data-start=\"696\">Clean, Conscious, &amp; Effective</strong></span><br data-end=\"732\" data-start=\"729\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><em data-end=\"893\" data-start=\"735\">&ldquo;Clean ingredients. Clear skin. Confidence unlocked. Vanity Collective blends science-backed skincare with clean beauty standards &mdash; no fluff, just results.&rdquo;</em></span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1051\" data-start=\"895\" style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1051\" data-start=\"898\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong data-end=\"920\" data-start=\"898\">Routine Reinvented</strong></span><br data-end=\"923\" data-start=\"920\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><em data-end=\"1051\" data-start=\"926\">&ldquo;Ditch the 10-step routines. The Clear Collection Box gives you exactly what your skin needs &mdash; no guesswork, no overwhelm.&rdquo;</em></span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&bull; Payment terms: See Contract&nbsp;</span></div>\r\n<div><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"></span></div>",
